<title>USA: Uniforce Services to start AMEX trading.</title>
<headline>Uniforce Services to start AMEX trading.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uniforce Services Inc said on Wednesday that its common stock would begin trading on the American Stock Exchange under the symbol &quot;UFR&quot; on June 26.</p>
<p>The company's common stock will cease trading on the Nasdaq National Market after the close on June 25.</p>
<p>Uniforce provides supplemental staffing services.</p>
</text>
